# Buildroot makeusers table (BR2_ROOTFS_USERS_TABLES). The image has no
# systemd-sysusers, so users that services expect are created at build time.
# Columns: username uid group gid password home shell groups comment.
#
# orion-node.service runs as orion (Orion packaging/buildroot/orion-users.table).
orion -1 orion -1 * /var/lib/orion /bin/false dialout Orion node
